1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:05,038
(Sheldon:)Sorry. As I told you,
the hero always peeks.

2
00:00:14,168 --> 00:00:17,628
(Howard:)-Anything?
-No, that was the last pudding cup.

3
00:00:17,963 --> 00:00:20,133
(Raj:)No.

4
00:00:20,299 --> 00:00:22,259
(Howard:)What about Slim Jims?

5
00:00:22,802 --> 00:00:25,842
(Leonard:)That's what he used
to eat his pudding, remember?

6
00:00:26,722 --> 00:00:30,142
Right. That was so good.

7
00:00:30,851 --> 00:00:34,141
Sweetie and meaty at the same time.

8
00:00:34,313 --> 00:00:37,853
(Howard:)Wait, wait, wait.
So you're saying we're out of food?

9
00:00:38,025 --> 00:00:40,485
The only thing in here are blue-ice packs.

10
00:00:41,362 --> 00:00:42,612
(Raj:)I know they're poison...

11
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:47,200
(Raj:)...but they look like
big, yummy Otter Pops.

12
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:50,870
(Leonard:)-Oh, God, I am so hungry.
-Me too.

13
00:00:51,705 --> 00:00:54,415
(Howard:)Check and see
if we have any more pudding.

14
00:00:56,544 --> 00:01:01,024
(Raj:)Okay.

